---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy · SentencePiece Guide" description="How SentencePiece Guide handles technical usage data and messages.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-xgb-lime mb-3">SentencePiece Guide</p>
    <h1 class="font-mono text-3xl text-xgb-ink font-bold mb-8">Privacy</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
      <p>This independent educational site can be read without creating an account.</p>
      <h2>Information we receive</h2>
      <p>Hosting and security services may process standard request information such as time, browser type, approximate location and IP address. If you contact us, we receive the details you choose to provide.</p>
      <h2>How it is used</h2>
      <p>Technical data helps us secure and improve the site. Messages are used to respond to the relevant correction or suggestion. We do not sell personal information.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For a privacy request, include the affected URL and the nature of your request.</p>
      <p><small>Last updated: 2 August 2026.</small></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
